    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'DWYER ARE EAGER TO BRING TO THE MARKET THIS EXCLUSIVE DEVELOPMENT OF SPACIOUS SEMI DETACHED & DETACHED RESIDENCES IN THE POPULAR DEVELOPMENT OF YEW PARK ALONG THE VIRGINIA/DUBLIN ROAD."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - \n\n\nStudy - \n\n\nKitchen/dining room - \n\n\nUtility Room - \n\n\nWC - \n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - \n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - \n\n\nBedroom 4 - \n\n\nBathroom - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Bookings now being accepted for this exclusive new development of beautifully designed A2 Energy Rated homes</li><li> Located in highly popular town of Virginia along the Cavan/Meath border, this development offers quiet country retreat, yet within 1 hours drive to Dublin City.</li><li> The town boasts a primary and secondary schools, a range of shops and pubs and a variety of recreational facilities including GAA grounds and the renowned fishing lake of Lough Ramor.</li><li> This the latest and final launch of this popular development comprises of only 8 no. new dwellings with a range of semi detcahed detached dwellings.</li><li> The houses are perfectly designed for families, first-time buyers, and those looking to downsize without compromising on comfort or style.</li><li> Each home is finished to an exceptional standard, offering an array of premium features as standard not optional upgrades.</li><li> Step inside to find contemporary interiors that combine style and practicality.</li><li> The fully fitted kitchens come complete with high end units and worktops.</li><li> Quality fitted sanitary ware with tiling fitted to wet areas in bathrooms.</li><li> A2 rated homes with specific attention on energy efficiency and insulation.</li><li> Eligible for the 'Help to Buy Scheme'.</li><li> Air to Water Heat Pump Central Heating</li><li> Mains Water Supply</li><li> Mains Sewerage</li><li> Outside, the attention to detail continues. Each property boasts a cobble-lock driveway</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Damian Keogan"
      }
    ],
